{
    "nodes": [
        {
            "id": "center",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "# Ralsei — the prince without subjects\n\nThird hero of the Prophecy. Kind to the point of self-denial — spends much of the game not believing he deserves anything of his own.",
            "x": -180,
            "y": -70,
            "width": 380,
            "height": 210,
            "color": "6"
        },
        {
            "id": "s0",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**Physical resemblance to Asriel**\nVisual basis for the 'Ralsei is Asriel' theory.",
            "x": -130,
            "y": -520,
            "width": 270,
            "height": 150,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "s1",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**Knows the ending of the Prophecy**\nHides the final part to protect Susie and Kris — it nearly breaks their friendship.",
            "x": 346,
            "y": -209,
            "width": 270,
            "height": 150,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "s2",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**Susie**\nPushes him to see himself as more than just a tool in service of the Lightners.",
            "x": 164,
            "y": 294,
            "width": 270,
            "height": 150,
            "color": "4"
        },
        {
            "id": "s3",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**Etymology of his name**\nAnagram of 'Asriel' + a reference to 'Ralse' from a game by Toby Fox's brother.",
            "x": -424,
            "y": 294,
            "width": 270,
            "height": 150,
            "color": "1"
        },
        {
            "id": "s4",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**Flowery**\nHis most strained relationship: old acquaintances through Asgore, now rivals.",
            "x": -606,
            "y": -209,
            "width": 270,
            "height": 150,
            "color": "1"
        },
        {
            "id": "s5",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**What is Ralsei, really?**\nFlowery calls him 'an impossibility': he appears in more than one Dark World, has no known Light World form, and knows too much about the Prophecy. No definitive textual explanation.",
            "x": 800,
            "y": 300,
            "width": 300,
            "height": 220,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "center-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/Ralsei_overworld_hatless.png",
            "x": -986,
            "y": -133,
            "width": 100,
            "height": 190
        },
        {
            "id": "s0-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/asriel.png",
            "x": -129,
            "y": -920,
            "width": 99,
            "height": 190
        },
        {
            "id": "s1-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/Profecy.gif",
            "x": 709,
            "y": -357,
            "width": 190,
            "height": 190
        },
        {
            "id": "s2-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/Susie_overworld_eyes.png",
            "x": 418,
            "y": 561,
            "width": 108,
            "height": 190
        },
        {
            "id": "s3-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/Ralsei_con_gorro.gif",
            "x": -672,
            "y": 557,
            "width": 109,
            "height": 190
        },
        {
            "id": "s4-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/Flowery_face.webp",
            "x": -860,
            "y": -560,
            "width": 115,
            "height": 190
        },
        {
            "id": "s5-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/Ralsei_screenshot_overwhelmed_with_knowledge.png",
            "x": 800,
            "y": 80,
            "width": 200,
            "height": 150
        },
        {
            "id": "s6",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**Kris's original SOUL?**\nHis green heart and unconditional devotion would fit if the soul that truly belongs to Kris was never the red one the player carries.",
            "x": 550,
            "y": -650,
            "width": 280,
            "height": 160,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "s6-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/Kris_overworld_SOUL.png",
            "x": 560,
            "y": -870,
            "width": 140,
            "height": 190
        },
        {
            "id": "s7",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**A tree or roots under Hometown?**\nWould explain why he 'appears' in every new Dark World without traveling: he just sprouts at a different point of the same root system.",
            "x": -130,
            "y": 700,
            "width": 300,
            "height": 170,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "s7-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/32_roots_raices.gif",
            "x": -120,
            "y": 930,
            "width": 190,
            "height": 150
        },
        {
            "id": "s8",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**The knife Kris carries?**\nWould explain the same thing more literally, though he still appears even without Kris nearby, according to the Ch.5 credits.",
            "x": -1000,
            "y": 250,
            "width": 280,
            "height": 160,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "s8-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/Susie_and_Kris_overworld_knife_reveal.gif",
            "x": -1010,
            "y": 470,
            "width": 190,
            "height": 140
        },
        {
            "id": "s9",
            "type": "text",
            "text": "**A copy of Lord of the Hammer?**\nGerson's fantasy book, inspired by the Prophecy — would explain his impossible knowledge of the future.",
            "x": -550,
            "y": -750,
            "width": 290,
            "height": 170,
            "color": "3"
        },
        {
            "id": "s9-img",
            "type": "file",
            "file": "Sprites/Lord_of_the_Hammer_library_stant.webp",
            "x": -540,
            "y": -970,
            "width": 170,
            "height": 190
        }
    ],
